                <p>To eliminate manual intervention entirely, I engineered an unbroken, platform-agnostic cloud pipeline network built across three parallel automated data highways:</p>
                
                <ul class="architecture-list">
                    <li><strong>The Inbound Spark (HubSpot CRM API Node):</strong> Captures the precise instant a contract card drops into the <code>Closed Won</code> status gate, immediately shooting a raw JSON data packet across a secure internet network line.</li>
                    <li><strong>Data Purification Layer (Regular Expressions Formulation):</strong> Intercepts the raw payload mid-flight, executing server-side string manipulation functions to strip out messy typos, formatting inputs, and cleaning text arrays automatically.</li>
                    <li><strong>Multi-Branch Algorithmic Router:</strong> A green traffic routing logical switch duplicates the data packet across three completely isolated data highways based on real-time budget parameters:
                        <ul>
                            <li><strong>Route 1 (Standard budget):</strong> Provisions a Stripe Checkout instance, logs metadata parameters to Baserow Table A, and registers a low-priority notification string.</li>
                            <li><strong>Route 2 (Enterprise VIP budget):</strong> Generates a high-ticket formal Stripe Billing Invoice, auto-computes localized corporate tax via Stripe Tax compliance modules, and routes records strictly into Baserow Table B.</li>
                            <li><strong>Route 3 (User Verification Gate):</strong> Monitors account access logs, running queries directly across an isolated users table (Baserow Table C) to protect data integrity.</li>
                        </ul>
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </article>

